 "width": 560, "content": "*El borde no cambia a rojo en el código real: el error se comunica solo vía .form-error + aria-invalid (accesible pero sin contraste visual en el campo). **input:disabled tampoco tiene regla propia en main.css.", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "normal"}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "E8U0pb", "name": "Campo select", "width": 260, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "A3dnl", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "content": "Campo select", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": 0.6}, {"id": "EJlwc", "type": "ref", "ref": "UeNgN", "name": "Estado"}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "e9ZUO", "name": "Campo textarea", "width": 260, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "T3rwag", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "content": "Campo textarea", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": 0.6}, {"id": "q1Nvn", "type": "ref", "ref": "KCZ52", "name": "Motivo"}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "GrVlS", "name": "Buscador", "width": 280, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "Ejda4", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "content": "Buscador", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": 0.6}, {"id": "avDoH", "type": "ref", "ref": "b8SJQu", "name": "Búsqueda"}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "LtCEr", "name": "Fila", "width": "fill_container", "gap": 32, "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "d5VuGY", "name": "Etiqueta de sección", "width": 380, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "BAl02", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "content": "Etiqueta de sección", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": 0.6}, {"id": "nTviA", "type": "ref", "ref": "VPRud", "name": "Sección"}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "X