-04)", "descendants": {"ceuSg": {"icon": "mail", "fill": "$text.primary"}, "HNueU": {"content": "Correos", "fill": "$text.primary"}}}]}, {"id": "WE75T", "type": "ref", "ref": "H291p5", "name": "Hover", "fill": "$bg.hover", "descendants": {"ceuSg": {"icon": "mail", "fill": "$text.primary"}, "HNueU": {"content": "Correos", "fill": "$text.primary"}}}, {"type": "text", "id": "EchZh", "name": "Nota", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": 216, "content": "Hoy sin :focus-visible propio en .sb-nav-item (hallazgo DS-04). La fila \"Focus\" de arriba muestra la propuesta ya especificada: outline 2px solid accent, outline-offset:-2px.", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "normal"}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "pQFM7", "name": "Marca", "width": 394, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "RCfMm", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "content": "Marca", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": 0.6}, {"id": "jghdn", "type": "ref", "ref": "eidEb", "name": "Logotipo completo"}, {"id": "k8oV1H", "type": "ref", "ref": "XWg6F", "name": "Logotipo compacto"}, {"id": "BLCTq", "type": "ref", "ref": "EaQOq", "name": "Marca pública"}, {"type": "text", "id": "T2r9Hk", "name": "Nota técnica", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "Pencil no reescala hijos de layout:\"none\" al sobreescribir width/height de una instancia (confirmado empíricamente: el frame cambia de tamaño pero los paths quedan en sus coordenadas originales). Por eso el logo existe como dos componentes independientes con geometría propia (394×100 y 110×28) en vez de una instancia \"auto layout\" única y reescalable — es la única forma de que ambos tamaños rendericen fielmente hoy.", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "normal"}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "KmTPX", "name": "Símbolo y campana", "width": 200, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "v6f5Ge", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "content": "Símbolo y campana", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": 0.6}, {"type": "frame", "id": "HIzkr", "name": "Fila", "gap": 16, "alignItems": "center", "children": [{"id": "JYMW8", "type": "ref", "ref": "Y6rN1d", "name": "Símbolo"}, {"id": "qDjcz", "type": "ref", "ref": "XWg6F", "name": "Compacto (28px)"}, {"id": "yDxqY", "type": "ref", "ref": "JjMGW", "name": "Campana"}]}]}]}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "bKLbb", "name": "Fundación de escalamiento", "width": "fill_container", "layout": "vertical", "gap": 22, "children": [{"type": "frame", "id": "rapNB", "name": "Cabecera", "width": "fill_container", "stroke": "$border", "strokeWidth": {"bottom": 1}, "layout": "vertical", "gap": 4, "padding": [0, 0, 10, 0], "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "NGCPT", "name": "Título", "fill": "$danger.text", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "Fundación de escalamiento (Fase 3)", "fontFamily": "$font-display", "fontSize": "$fs-2xl", "fontWeight": "600", "letterSpacing": -0.2}, {"type": "text", "id": "kakyp", "name": "Nota", "fill": "$text.secondary", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "Base para módulos nuevos (Correos, Licencias, Equipos, Base de Conocimiento, Problemas, Encuestas): escala de espaciado, variant sets completos y propuesta de sidebar.", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-base", "fontWeight": "normal"}]}, {"type": "frame", "id": "a9FXxo", "name": "Escala de espaciado — space-1 a space-12", "width": "fill_container", "layout": "vertical", "gap": 10, "children": [{"type": "text", "id": "MRSfY", "name": "Etiqueta", "fill": "$text.tertiary", "textGrowth": "fixed-width", "width": "fill_container", "content": "ESCALA DE ESPACIADO — SPACE-1 A SPACE-12", "fontFamily": "$font-sans", "fontSize": "$fs-xs", "fontWeight": "600", "let